<p class="status"><b>Draft:</b> this policy should be checked by a qualified adviser before launch.</p>

<h2 id="collect">What we collect</h2>
<ul>
<li><strong>Email address</strong>, only if you subscribe to our newsletter. It is stored with our email provider, MailerLite, and used to send the briefing.</li>
<li><strong>Anonymous visit statistics</strong> through Cloudflare Web Analytics, which does not use cookies or track you across sites.</li>
<li><strong>Your theme choice</strong> (light or dark), saved in your browser only. It is not sent to us.</li>
</ul>
<p>We do not ask for patient information, and you should never send any to us.</p>

<h2 id="affiliate">Affiliate links</h2>
<p>When you click an affiliate link, the vendor may set its own cookies. Check their privacy policy. See the <a href="/disclosure/">affiliate disclosure</a>.</p>

<h2 id="rights">Your rights</h2>
<p>You can unsubscribe at any time from any email. To ask for access to, correction of or deletion of your data, <a href="/contact/">contact us</a>. You may also have rights under laws such as UK GDPR, the Australian Privacy Act or Canadian privacy law.</p>

<p>Last updated: 17 October 2026.</p>
